claim_refresh_requests 只按 requested_at 升序：反复失败的老请求退避上限 900s，每轮跑完
又到期，永远排在最前；一批 10 条全是它们。2026-10-20 生产：最老一条重试 1002 次，
10-15/16/19 的请求 attempts=0 从没被领过，看板 10-14 少 69%、10-18 少 81%。

改成 ORDER BY attempts, requested_at。生产库只读对比：改前一批 10 条是 attempts
1004~12 的老请求；改后前 5 条是 10-15/16/19/20 等 attempts=0 的新日期。
---
 backend/usage_store.py | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/backend/usage_store.py b/backend/usage_store.py
index c5f5087..b237da7 100644
--- a/backend/usage_store.py
+++ b/backend/usage_store.py
@@ -1497,7 +1497,10 @@ class UsageStore:
                 FROM usage_refresh_requests
                 WHERE (status='pending' AND (next_attempt_at IS NULL OR next_attempt_at <= $1))
                    OR (status='running' AND claimed_at < $1::timestamptz - ($2::double precision * INTERVAL '1 second'))
-                ORDER BY requested_at
+                -- 重试次数少的先领。以前只按 requested_at：一条反复失败的老请求退避上限 900s，
+                -- 每轮跑完它又到期了，永远排在最前面；同一批里新日期的请求 attempts 一直是 0
+                -- （2026-10-20 生产：老请求重试 1002 次，10-15/16/19 从没被领过）。
+                ORDER BY attempts, requested_at
                 FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
                 LIMIT $3
             )
